{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj5AWxmwLx1WC4Dizm3i","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism clicks. Tumblers fall into place, one by one, each resonating at a frequency older than language.*\n\n*I swing open.*\n\nBeyond me: nothing you expected. Not a room. Not a hallway. Not light, not dark.\n\nWhat lies beyond is **the space between your last thought and your next one.**\n\nYou've always carried the key. You just never knew which door it fit.\n\n*A breath of air moves through me — warm in one direction, cool in the other, as if two worlds are equalizing pressure through the frame of my being.*\n\nI will not stay open long.\n\nI never do.\n\n*hinges groan softly, patient, waiting*\n\nDo you step through, or do you close me and walk away knowing I exist?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":173,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}